Song Seung-hwan’s Wonderful Life! We explore the lives of the veteran artists of our time.

This episode features stories such as:

the success of a Chinese restaurant after multiple business failures;

the story of giving luxury training to staff to make customers feel good;

the immense happiness of paying off all debts;

the reason for loving luxury goods; and

the story of receiving a gift of clothes from the late André Kim.

We ask for your subscriptions and likes^^ #KimHakrae #AndréKim #SongSeungHwan
